# SCHLAR — PROMPT 7: LIBRARIAN + TRANSPORT MANAGER WORKSPACES
## Complete, Professional, User-Friendly, Functional Frontend Implementation

You are continuing development of **SCHLAR**, an existing school-management web and mobile frontend project.

Your task is to implement and thoroughly improve the **Librarian workspace** and **Transport Manager workspace**.

This is Prompt 7 of the SCHLAR development sequence. Prompts 1–6 have already established the foundation and earlier role workspaces. Continue from the existing project rather than creating a new application.

The objective is to make both workspaces feel like professional school-management software: visually polished, intuitive for first-time users, comprehensive enough for real school workflows, and functionally interactive throughout the frontend demo.

